SUMMARY:Winter Wonderland at The Beach
LOCATION:Myrtle Beach Boardwalk\, N Ocean Blvd & 9th Ave N\, Myrtle Beach\
 , SC 29577
DESCRIPTION:Free holiday lights along the 1.2-mile oceanfront boardwalk ev
 ery night. On Saturday\, the city tree lighting at Plyler Park (5:30–7 p
 m\, tree lit at 6:30) brings choirs\, holiday characters and photos with S
 anta. Free. Details: https://weekendscout.app/e/myrtle-beach/winter-wonder
 land-at-the-beach-2026-11-27/
