UID:myrtle-beach-intracoastal-christmas-regatta-2026-11-28-sat-0@weekendscout.app
DTSTAMP:20261126T084518Z
DTSTART:20261128T220000Z
DTEND:20261129T000000Z
SUMMARY:Intracoastal Christmas Regatta
LOCATION:Dock Holidays Marina\, 1525 13th Ave N\, North Myrtle Beach\, SC 
 29582
DESCRIPTION:Decorated\, lit-up boats parade down the Intracoastal Waterway
  from Little River Inlet around 5 pm\, reaching Dock Holidays Marina aroun
 d 7 pm. Organizers ask for new toys for Yachts for Tots or pet supplies fo
 r the local humane society. Free to watch. Details: https://weekendscout.a
 pp/e/myrtle-beach/intracoastal-christmas-regatta-2026-11-28/
URL:https://weekendscout.app/e/myrtle-beach/intracoastal-christmas-regatta-2026-11-28/
END:VEVENT
